#slide[
  #set page(margin: (bottom: 0cm, right: 0.5cm))
  = #lunal Stuff can go wrong D: #lunar
  #v(1em)
  #set text(size: 18pt)

  #show: later
  1. Declare secrets A and B. B depends on A.
  2. Generate them successfully!
  #show: later
  3. Tweak A's script, run the CLI with `--generate a`.
  4. Oh no! B's script has a bug that makes it crash :(
  #show: later
  5. Fix the bug & run the CLI without `--generate a`.
  6. No reason for the CLI to update B; inconsistent state :(

  #set align(right + bottom)
  #image("assets/grayno.webp", height: 6.5cm)
]
